# AB-027: Recharging a buffer restores pH but accumulates salt
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.002mol
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 conductivity
add v1 HCl 0.0004mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0004mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 conductivity
add v1 HCl 0.0004mol
add v1 NaOH 0.0004mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 conductivity
inspect
